Package: ucdpR
Title: Download Data from the Uppsala Conflict Data Program
Version: 0.2.2
Authors@R: person("Christian", "Oswald", email = "christian.oswald@unibw.de", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Discovers, downloads, and imports datasets published by the
    Uppsala Conflict Data Program ('UCDP') <https://ucdp.uu.se/>. The package
    reads the official download catalog at run time, supports reproducible
    file downloads, and imports common tabular formats without bundling or
    modifying UCDP data.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/christianoswald/ucdpR, https://christianoswald.github.io/ucdpR/
BugReports: https://github.com/christianoswald/ucdpR/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    cli,
    httr2,
    rvest,
    tibble,
    xml2
Suggests:
